.TH "Docv::Layout::TableLayout" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Layout::TableLayout \- Renders a \fB\%Table\fR into rows: column widths from content and \fB\%w()\fR minimums, text blocks filled to fit the width when wrapping, an \fB\%expand\fR table widened to the full width, rules and frames drawn with box\-drawing characters.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Layout::TableLayout\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Renders a \fB\%Table\fR into rows: column widths from content and \fB\%w()\fR
minimums, text blocks filled to fit the width when wrapping, an
\fB\%expand\fR table widened to the full width, rules and frames drawn with
box\-drawing characters.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.PP
\fBRULE_STYLE = 0_u16\fR
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(table : Table, layout : Layout)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef rows(indent : Int32, width : Int32, wrap : Bool) : Array(Row)\fR
Rows of the table at \fIindent\fR within \fIwidth\fR.
